Vendored rather than fetched at build time so the host tests and the APK build need no
network, and so the derived weight blob shipped in app/src/main/assets is reproducible from
a file in this repository.

The .onnx itself is NOT shipped in the APK. What ships is silero_vad_weights.bin, produced
from this file by tools/silero/extract_weights.py — the same 309,633 parameters with the
ONNX container removed. Both are the same MIT-licensed work.
